{"id":49635,"date":"2026-02-21T20:15:34","date_gmt":"2026-02-21T19:15:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=49635"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:31:26","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:31:26","slug":"acropolis-the-iron-challenge","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/acropolis-the-iron-challenge\/","title":{"rendered":"Acropolis \u2013 The Iron Challenge 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Acropolis \u2013 The Iron Challenge 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Acropolis \u2013 The Iron Challenge 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 uma das mais espetaculares corridas de obst\u00e1culos (OCR) de Portugal, decorrendo na hist\u00f3rica freguesia de <strong>Briteiros S\u00e3o Salvador<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Guimar\u00e3es<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>). O tra\u00e7ado combina a beleza natural envolvente, trilhos florestais t\u00e9cnicos e a m\u00edtica passagem pelas imedia\u00e7\u00f5es da Cit\u00e2nia de Briteiros com dezenas de estruturas artificiais e obst\u00e1culos de lama, for\u00e7a, suspens\u00e3o e equil\u00edbrio.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com as op\u00e7\u00f5es de <strong>12 km Elite<\/strong> (supera\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria a solo para pontua\u00e7\u00e3o competitiva), <strong>12 km Open<\/strong> (com partidas escalonadas em vagas) e <strong>5 km Open<\/strong> (ideal para inicia\u00e7\u00e3o e divers\u00e3o em grupo), o evento re\u00fane atletas de todo o pa\u00eds. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Social e Desportiva do Febras<\/strong> assegura uma produ\u00e7\u00e3o de n\u00edvel internacional, apoio m\u00e9dico, balizagem rigorosa e cronometragem oficial Lap2Go.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13